  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城旅馆（106.38），全员与旅馆主人（8.18）对话，选“是”获得【调查请求信】。",
      "type": "solo-item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆等级低于Lv.15或组队状态下无法获得【调查请求信】；",
      "type": "level-and-group-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.夜晚，前往法兰城（108.31）处，解放队伍，调查旅馆后门（107.31），选“是”进入旅馆。",
      "type": "timed-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆组队状态下无法调查旅馆后门",
      "type": "solo-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "3.与总负责人（7.6）对话，交出【调查请求信】获得【打火石？】。",
      "type": "conditional-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "◆未持有【调查请求信】与总负责人对话，获得【打火石】",
      "type": "alternate-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "4.调查火炉（25.17）进入，选两次“是”，队长交出【打火石？】全队传送至暖炉的底部。通过（1.8）处，抵达暖炉之底。",
      "type": "party-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "◆暖炉之底为随机迷宫，约5层；迷宫刷新时间：4小时；",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "魔物为Lv.13~15僵尸、幽灵、史莱姆，数量最多6",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "僵尸，属性：风60地40，不死系；技能：攻击、防御、吸血攻击、诸刃",
      "type": "enemy-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "幽灵，属性：水80地20，不死系；技能：攻击、防御、崩击、强力昏睡魔法",
      "type": "enemy-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "史莱姆，属性：地90风10，特殊系；技能：攻击、防御、毒性攻击",
      "type": "enemy-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "5.通过随机迷宫抵达腐朽的祠堂，与亡灵骑士（24.6）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Lv.25亡灵骑士*3，2动，血量约850，属性：地70水30，邪魔系，不抗毒；技能：攻击、攻击（血多者）、圣盾、崩击、吸血攻击、战栗袭心",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "Lv.20僵尸*1~2，血量约400，属性：风60地40，不死系；技能：攻击、吸血攻击、诸刃",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Lv.20幽灵*1~2，血量约400，属性：水80地20，不死系；技能：攻击、防御、强力冰冻魔法、强力昏睡魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "6.战斗胜利后，队伍中成员随机获得【诅咒的首饰】*1~3，并传送回旅馆。",
      "type": "battle-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆诅咒的首饰：Lv.3项链、耐久150~200；攻击、防御、敏捷-2；可以交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "7.与旅馆主人（8.18）对话，选“是”，交出【诅咒的首饰】获得【旅馆招待券？】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "⑴持有【旅馆招待券？】与大圣堂2楼客房科学家欧兹启（13.23）对话，选“是”交出【旅馆招待券？】，",
      "type": "post-quest-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "随机获得1组（20个）【铁】、【铜】、【柠檬草】、【鸡蛋】、【麻布】",
      "type": "reward-pool",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "⑵持有【诅咒的首饰】与大圣堂2楼客房内解咒师迪杰努（12.21）对话，交出【诅咒的首饰】、100G获得【项链？】。",
      "type": "post-quest-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆【项链？】，鉴定后为【失魂的首饰】",
      "type": "identified-item",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "失魂的首饰：Lv.3项链、耐久100~150；攻击、防御、敏捷-3~+5；可以交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "◆任务剧情：参考《旅馆调查任务剧情对话》",
      "type": "story-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
